cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CACE-Bench: A Synthetic Agentic Evaluation Benchmark for LLM Credit-Pipeline Agents"
abstract: "Compliance-Aware Credit-agent Evaluation (CACE-Bench): a fully synthetic, reproducible benchmark and generator for evaluating and auto-evolving LLM-agent credit pipelines under auditability constraints. Measures hallucination rate, recovery rate, compliance false-positive rate and step-level correctness across dialogue, task and agent levels."
type: software
